istic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/listRowInsets(_:)":{"abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/listrowinsets(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"listRowInsets","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"EdgeInsets","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI10EdgeInsetsV"},{"text":"?) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}],"title":"listRowInsets(_:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/listRowInsets(_:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"}}}